    "detailed_description": "<h1>HELL'S BELLS - COMING SOON!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/6e1abf1840d9ae03fc7ed594c74dd2cf.poster.avif?t=1755712945\" width=690 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/6e1abf1840d9ae03fc7ed594c74dd2cf.webm?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/6e1abf1840d9ae03fc7ed594c74dd2cf.mp4?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/82660136b23741ab3d9348ca6921a78a.poster.avif?t=1755712945\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/82660136b23741ab3d9348ca6921a78a.webm?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/82660136b23741ab3d9348ca6921a78a.mp4?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell's Bells is an erotic visual novel with a focus on submission, ritual, and temptation. Set within the walls of a towering cathedral far beneath the surface, you'll encounter three dominant figures, each with their own methods of control, punishment, and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path. Endure their trials. Unlock scenes and storylines hidden behind obedience and forbidden curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/c7bd66f4e9c68bec7c6dda4ce241f02a.poster.avif?t=1755712945\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/c7bd66f4e9c68bec7c6dda4ce241f02a.webm?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/c7bd66f4e9c68bec7c6dda4ce241f02a.mp4?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Belles aren't just characters, they're forces that shape the world around you. Each brings a distinct presence that subtly twists the game's atmosphere, challenges, and tone, ensuring no two encounters feel quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/09920120e7266b752222e8d77be7e42d.avif?t=1755712945\" width=848 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Sister Mercy \u2013 The Poised Dominatrix</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coldly elegant and unflinchingly composed, Sister Mercy carries herself with the chilling authority of one who expects to be obeyed. Her punishments are precise, her affection conditional, and her trials always laced with the suggestion that true devotion is earned through pain, not pleading. To follow her is to surrender with dignity... or be stripped of it entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/16ce8c1bd0aa42854e75688e4c452f37.avif?t=1755712945\" width=848 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf39 Sister Cruelle \u2013 The Cruel Enforcer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stern, severe, and cloaked in the trappings of ancient rites, Sister Cruelle delivers judgment with a ritualistic flair that borders on the sacred. Her world is one of iron discipline and harsh ceremony, where mercy is weakness and submission must be absolute. She doesn\u2019t just demand obedience... she carves it into you, one lesson at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/5e167c368ebaebccacd869dfc25d3056.avif?t=1755712945\" width=848 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 Sister Chastity \u2013 The Sweet-spoken Corruptor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft of voice and warm of smile, Sister Chastity disarms with kindness even as she unravels your will. Her touch is gentle, her words almost innocent, but every moment with her leads you deeper into a velvet-lined trap. She doesn\u2019t break you with force; she makes you want to be broken. And once you start to slip, she never lets go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices not only define your relationship, but unlock hidden scenes, secrets, and achievements.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/82660136b23741ab3d9348ca6921a78a.poster.avif?t=1755712945\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/82660136b23741ab3d9348ca6921a78a.webm?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/82660136b23741ab3d9348ca6921a78a.mp4?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell's Bells is an erotic visual novel with a focus on submission, ritual, and temptation. Set within the walls of a towering cathedral far beneath the surface, you'll encounter three dominant figures, each with their own methods of control, punishment, and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path. Endure their trials. Unlock scenes and storylines hidden behind obedience and forbidden curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/c7bd66f4e9c68bec7c6dda4ce241f02a.poster.avif?t=1755712945\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/c7bd66f4e9c68bec7c6dda4ce241f02a.webm?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/c7bd66f4e9c68bec7c6dda4ce241f02a.mp4?t=1755712945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Belles aren't just characters, they're forces that shape the world around you. Each brings a distinct presence that subtly twists the game's atmosphere, challenges, and tone, ensuring no two encounters feel quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/09920120e7266b752222e8d77be7e42d.avif?t=1755712945\" width=848 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Sister Mercy \u2013 The Poised Dominatrix</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coldly elegant and unflinchingly composed, Sister Mercy carries herself with the chilling authority of one who expects to be obeyed. Her punishments are precise, her affection conditional, and her trials always laced with the suggestion that true devotion is earned through pain, not pleading. To follow her is to surrender with dignity... or be stripped of it entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/16ce8c1bd0aa42854e75688e4c452f37.avif?t=1755712945\" width=848 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf39 Sister Cruelle \u2013 The Cruel Enforcer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stern, severe, and cloaked in the trappings of ancient rites, Sister Cruelle delivers judgment with a ritualistic flair that borders on the sacred. Her world is one of iron discipline and harsh ceremony, where mercy is weakness and submission must be absolute. She doesn\u2019t just demand obedience... she carves it into you, one lesson at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/5e167c368ebaebccacd869dfc25d3056.avif?t=1755712945\" width=848 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 Sister Chastity \u2013 The Sweet-spoken Corruptor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft of voice and warm of smile, Sister Chastity disarms with kindness even as she unravels your will. Her touch is gentle, her words almost innocent, but every moment with her leads you deeper into a velvet-lined trap. She doesn\u2019t break you with force; she makes you want to be broken. And once you start to slip, she never lets go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices not only define your relationship, but unlock hidden scenes, secrets, and achievements.</p>",
    "short_description": "In a cathedral beneath Hell, three dominant Sisters await your submission. Choose your path, endure sacred punishment, and unlock forbidden scenes in this dark, stylized visual novel. Obedience isn\u2019t asked for... it\u2019s taken.",
